config AIC_BLE_IMG_PUSH
    bool "BLE image push GATT server (FF00)"
    default n
    depends on LPKG_USING_ZEPHYR_BLUETOOTH
    depends on AIC_WIRELESS_LAN
    select AIC_USING_UART3
    select LPKG_BT_PERIPHERAL
    select CONFIG_AIC8800_BT_SUPPORT
    help
        D126 BLE image push. Advertises AYYDDFQ, GATT service FF00
        (CTRL FF01 / DATA FF02 / STATUS FF03). HCI uses on-chip UART3.
